; Start of interlude 1 (chapter 3)
@set currentChapter=3



; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

; close the website if it's open
@onCloseWebCommand

; open the chat window
@showPrinter Chat
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

@printer Chat
Maurice: noa
Maurice: noa
Maurice: noa
Maurice: Noanoanoanoa

; show choices
@choice "shut up." handler:ChatReply goto:.shut_up
@choice "what's up??" handler:ChatReply goto:.what's_up
@stop


; if the player chooses shut up
# shut_up
@printer Chat
Noa: ******* Maurice

; print dialogue
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: The fuck?
@goto .Continue


# what's_up
@printer Chat
Noa: what's up?
@goto .Continue


# Continue
; print chat
@printer Chat 
Maurice: Tahnk goodness youre still here
Maurice: you saw it already?

Noa: ?

Maurice: the web noa it
Maurice: it happened
Maurice: the *********************************
Maurice: ****

;  Black screen. HUMMING COMPUTER SFX STOP. BARKING DOGS SFX ON. 

@clearBacklog
@hideUI Desktop
@hideUI WelcomeScreen

@stopSfx Pc_hum_sfx
@sfx dog_bark_sfx
@hidePrinter Chat


@wait 3

; show dialogue box
@showPrinter Dialogue 
@printer Dialogue hideOther!
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

Noa: Bloody hell.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue

; Computer boosting noices. Fade in Welcome screen. Fade in the desktop screen. SFX HUMMING PC ON THE LOOP. MAIN MUSIC OST ON THE LOOP. PLAYER NOT IN CONTROL. Chat window opens. There is following message

@sfx Pc_Welcome_sfx
@wait 0.2

; fade in the welcome screen
@showUI WelcomeScreen

@wait 5

; fade in the desktop screen with pc hum on loop
@showUI Desktop
@sfx Pc_hum_sfx loop:true

; Play main music on the loop here when asset is ready


; open chat window
@showPrinter Chat
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@resetText Chat

@printer Chat
We detected suspicious activity.
You will be able to exchange messages again in 10 minutes.

; show dialogue box
@showPrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: Fuck.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@hidePrinter Chat
@onDialogueClosedCommand

# Beata
; show beata
@printer Bubble.Left pos:-5,70
@wait 0.5
@showPrinter Bubble
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Bubble.Left pos:40,70

Beata: Good morning! I’m Beata, your favorite virtual assistant!
Beata: I hope you’re enjoying your day!
Beata: Please, let me know if there’s anything I can help you with.


; show dialogue box
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "What the fuck?"
Noa: "How did you get on my computer?"

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue


@printer Bubble.Left
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@resetText Bubble

@wait 0.5
Beata: We’ve noticed that you don’t have Beata of your own!
Beata: According to the Online Safety Act, Clause 4(a), if you can’t install Beata, Daystar will do it for you!
Beata: I’m now fully integrated with your system. We’re going to be best friends forever!

; Beata disappears
@printer Bubble.Left pos:-10,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@onDialogueClosedCommand

; wait for a moment
@wait 1

; show dialogue box
@resetText Dialogue
@showPrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

@printer Dialogue
Noa: I should ignore it – and the itch to throw my computer out of the window – for now.
Noa: I need to contact Maurice.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue

@wait 2

; show call window
@onShowCallWindowCommand

@printer Dialogue
Noa: "Sorry, dude. My PC crashed."
Noa: "You were saying?"

@printer FriendDialogue
Maurice: "How are you so calm???"

@printer Dialogue
Noa: "Probably because I still have no idea what’s going on?"
Noa: "Enlighten me."

; call event here that changes the call window to glitch 1 effect with glitch sound
@onChangeCallWindowToGlitch1Command
@sfx glitch_1_sfx

@printer FriendDialogue
Maurice: ******************************
Maurice: *********************

; call event here that changes the call window to glitch 2 effect with glitch sound
@onChangeCallWindowToGlitch2Command
@sfx glitch_2_sfx

Maurice: **************************

@printer Dialogue
Noa: "Dude, I can’t hear you."

; call event here that changes the call window back to normal effect with glitch sound
@onChangeCallWindowToNormalCommand
@sfx glitch_1_sfx

@printer FriendDialogue
Maurice: "********** guess they’re doing the same thing as with the chat."
Maurice: "So I’m gonna be very vague."
Maurice: "The thing we were..."
Maurice: "cautious?"
Maurice: "about"
Maurice: "It happened."
Maurice: "You haven’t checked out Verything or Clover yet?"


@printer Dialogue
Noa: "No."

@printer FriendDialogue
Maurice: "It’s all whitewashed."

@printer Dialogue
Noa: "I see. I get it now why I suddenly need to call pest control."

;  Beata appears on the left side of the screen. 
@printer Bubble.Left pos:-5,70
@wait 0.5
@showPrinter Bubble
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Bubble.Left pos:40,70
Beata: "Butterflies aren’t pests!"
Beata: "Although some caterpillars can be destructive to crops."
Beata: "But you have nothing to fear! Beata, your favorite virtual assistant, is a fully mature butterfly!"
Baeta: "Your crops are safe!""

; Beata disappears
@printer Bubble.Left pos:-10,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble

; wait for a moment
@wait 1

@showPrinter FriendDialogue
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer FriendDialogue
Maurice: "Yeah. There’s also that."

@printer Dialogue
Noa: "And our friends?"

@printer FriendDialogue
Maurice: "Unavailable. I think..."
Maurice: "I don’t want to think about it."
Maurice: "Check the files?"

@printer Dialogue
Noa: "Sure. Give me a sec."

@set currentTask="Interact with folder files"





; hide call window and dialogue box
@onHideCallWindowCommand
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@hidePrinter FriendDialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@stop

; player is now in control and can check the files on the desktop

# Start_Archives_Section
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@wait 1

@showPrinter Dialogue
@printer Dialogue
Noa: "No luck."
Noa: We planned for this. In case something happens...
Noa: Step one: download summer photos from Archives.
Noa: Step two: find passwords on their pages.
Noa: Step three: get access to the folder.

;  Folder3 window closes. Player not in control. 
@onCloseFolder3AppCommand
@onShowCallWindowCommand

@printer Dialogue
Noa: "I’ll take Alex and Sawyer. You do the rest."
Noa: "Got it. Text me if anything comes up."
Noa: "Stay safe, Maurice."

@showPrinter FriendDialogue
@printer FriendDialogue
Maurice: "Thanks, dude. You too."

; Call and chat closes. 
@onHideCallWindowCommand
@hidePrinter FriendDialogue
@hidePrinter Chat
@resetText FriendDialogue
@resetText Chat
@resetText Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

; set the current task to download summer photos
@set currentTask="Download summer photos from Archives"

@stop

# Pick_Website_Section
; player is now in control and can pick the websites to visit


; give the player the choice to pick either CLover or Chatter
@choice "Go to Clover" handler:ButtonList goto:Chapter4/Chapter4.Label_Clover
@choice "Go to Chatter" handler:ButtonList


@stop